+...#yr#yy#ry#...
+...#rrr##rrr#...
+....#rr##rr#....
+....###..###....
+[back]
+.....######.....
+....#yyyyyy#....
+...#yyyyyyyy#...
+.###rrrrrrrr###.
+#yyyyyyyyyyyyyy#
+.###yyyyyyyy###.
+...#rrrrrrrr#...
+...#ryyyyyyr#...
+...#ryyyyyyr#...
+....#ryyyyr#....
+....##yyyy##....
+...#rryyyyrr#...
+...#yrrrrrry#...
+...#rrr##rrr#...
+....#rr##rr#....
+....###..###....
+[left]
+.......#####....
+......#yyyyy#...
+.....#yyyyyyy#..
+....#rrrrrrrr#..
+..##yyyyyyyyyy#.
+.#yyyyyyyyyyyyy#
+..####rrrrrr###.
+.....#y#yyrr#...
+....#yyyyyrr#...
+...#####yyrr#...
+....####yrr#....
+.....#yyyyrr#...
+.....#yr#rrr#...
+.....#yr#rrr#...
+.....#rr##rr#...
+.....#######....
